{"file": "e3d75ea9932903d371fcbcfd6445ccdf.parquet", "n_captions": 526605, "matches": [{"norm": "two dogs", "prompt_ids": [1972], "exact": 0, "contained": 6, "examples": [{"kind": "contained", "uid": "7c37d322d60b04ae5001bf8b96b7354e", "url": "https://products2.imgix.drizly.com/ci-black-elephant-two-dogs-a-peacock-a-horse-sauvignon-blanc-316657d43bbf4e9c.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fm=jpeg&amp;q=20", "text": "Black Elephant Two Dogs, A Peacock &amp; A Horse Sauvignon Blanc"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "b1493e45a7e4b1aa790d051dfbd7e6b9", "url": "https://kathrynpaulcelebrant.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/bride-with-pet.jpg", "text": "Bride & Groom with two dogs : How to include pets in your wedding ceremony."}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "7881866457eae8c868f2504be044c244", "url": "https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/21/e7/e8/21e7e839746827f818cd0e67c1f41f75.jpg", "text": "An injured dog unable to move from a frozen rail track was protected by her companion for two days over Christmas as he kept her warm and pushed her head down when trains passed overhead. This heartwarming tale of fierce loyalty played out near a small railway station in western Ukraine\u2019s Uzhhorod, where a train conductor alerted locals after he spotted two dogs huddled on the tracks on December 25, according to Facebook user Denis Malafeev , who shared this footage. It was even a struggle\u2026"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "414dddf9360462921ae7334f6ee5a03f", "url": "https://i.dailymail.co.uk/i/pix/2016/08/30/16/37B1252700000578-3765033-image-a-37_1472571921217.jpg", "text": "These two dogs look as confused as each other - while there's plenty of room for the smaller dog in the Irish wolfhound's bed, the same can't be said for his canine counterpart"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "9a3ed83b791d617d2fab7c93a3ceffdc", "url": "https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/f9/8a/de/f98ade2c558bf612602dc7439a0268be.jpg", "text": "Two dogs who met at shelter only have each other and hearts full of hope"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "285f69fcf0f5581d655c388e2017391a", "url": "http://media.istockphoto.com/photos/woman-out-walking-two-dogs-in-a-forest-picture-id532865740?k=6&amp;m=532865740&amp;s=170667a&amp;w=0&amp;h=vWt1dJOOzPH1vJ4CkPI_I7rGFHZoHqILwr36wNDHVho=", "text": "Woman out walking two dogs in a forest stock photo"}]}, {"norm": "three boys", "prompt_ids": [2008], "exact": 0, "contained": 3, "examples": [{"kind": "contained", "uid": "ec99b74f9dd9c22886fc8b55ccdd3ab9", "url": "https://mabel.wwu.edu/sites/default/files/styles/islandora_imagecache_image_style_medium/public/sites/default/files/private/externals/568a76ab7278003b7aadff7ba1beaed9.jpg?itok=U07PBkZ2&solr_nav%5Bid%5D=c1693b750afb0c64d795&solr_nav%5Bpage%5D=0&solr_nav%5Boffset%5D=6", "text": "Three boys pose atop the boiler and inside the smoke stack of a steam engine that has colided with a larger engine"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "94ffd31d89efb203ca52122b8b28136a", "url": "https://mabel.wwu.edu/sites/default/files/styles/islandora_imagecache_image_style_medium/public/sites/default/files/private/externals/da99bcc500e66008441bab143976969d.jpg?itok=gH_Zv5GI&solr_nav%5Bid%5D=1283b014db7cdadd1b9c&solr_nav%5Bpage%5D=0&solr_nav%5Boffset%5D=24", "text": "1909 Three Boys Working in Shop"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "c33f3b8049d30adbf1ae5add01f1dd70", "url": "https://api.army.mil/e2/c/images/2021/02/09/382805b7/size0-full.jpg", "text": "FORT LEE, Va. (Feb. 9, 2021) \u2013 Johnny Soto Sr., former husband of Master Sgt. Lisa Maria Soto, shares memories of their relationship during a memorial service Feb. 5 at Memorial Chapel here. MSG Soto, a Soldier of 20 years and mother of three boys, died Jan. 2 from complications related to the coronavirus.  Mr. Soto described how she conquered the struggles of a difficult upbringing and was a nurturing mother and friend to many. \u201cLisa used her childhood as motivation to mold our children to be stand-up young men,\u201d he said. \u201cNot only that, she was a beacon of hope for all of those who needed encouragement or a listening ear.\u201d Lt. Col. Denis Fajardo, MSG Soto\u2019s battalion commander,  also shared remarks, noting Soto extended herself as a Soldier. \u201cShe took taking care of Soldiers and teaching them seriously and with a passion that was noticed by all,\u201d said the leader of the 244th Quartermaster Battalion. \u201cShe was always eager to help get things done. As we mourn her loss, also remember her sacrifice, determination, resilience and love for her family.\u201d  Among MSG Soto\u2019s survivors are her three children, a twin sister, Letha, and six other siblings; and her father, Jonell McFadden Jr. (U.S. Army Photo by T. Anthony Bell)."}]}, {"norm": "two swans", "prompt_ids": [1996], "exact": 0, "contained": 2, "examples": [{"kind": "contained", "uid": "7d68e0696207c01fddfa64cefc9afc66", "url": "https://ih0.redbubble.net/image.11188739.7395/flat,135x135,075,t.u2.jpg", "text": "Two Swans In Flight by Kathy Baccari"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "034c89e49924ce6cdf30b913ba96b93b", "url": "http://www.supercoloring.com/sites/default/files/styles/coloring_thumbnail/public/cif/2018/07/swans-sliding-coloring-page.png", "text": "Two Swans from Swans"}]}, {"norm": "two boys", "prompt_ids": [1953], "exact": 0, "contained": 13, "examples": [{"kind": "contained", "uid": "ca603963ba3fc7768e9ccbad16536801", "url": "https://www.contiki.com/six-two/wp-content/uploads/2015/08/adventure-travel-3-1024x576.jpg", "text": "adventure travel - image of two boys jumping from a boat"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "4fdf0575528d16d8141363de9410f1ef", "url": "https://us.123rf.com/450wm/imagesourceprem/imagesourceprem1706/imagesourceprem170616315/80214934-two-boys-racing-on-country-lane.jpg?ver=6", "text": "rival: Two boys racing on country lane"}, {"kind": "contained", "uid": "acb8e9fe5c546633f016f440cb77c85c", "url": "https://static0.iphotos.com/thumbs/047/batch_10/2-4_Year_Olds/mon150042_tnb.png", "tex